'''Door''' was a {{Rare}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costed {{Money|950,000}} or {{Robux|1,400}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Door used to be the best [[Blox Fruit]] for mobility and travel. Unlike its newer counterpart, Door was mainly considered useful for travel, with decent potential in PvP.

__TOC__{{Clr}}

